OL,3,AUK economy grows at fastest rate for
OL,4,Amore than two years
OL,5,
OL,6,FStrong growth in the services sector -
OL,7,Fthe largest part of the economy, which
OL,8,Fincludes non-physical goods such as
OL,9,Fconsultancy services and computer
OL,10,Fprogramming as well as hotels and
OL,11,Frestaurants - helped boost the numbers.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
